Hi @younes-212, thanks for the submission! 👋

I'm going to close this one, because the automated checks flag two blockers that need resolving at the source before the repository can be added:

1. The owner check fails: your account isn't listed as an owner or a major contributor of `Ilumen-MAdomotique/ha-newtron`. HACS requires the submitter to be the repository owner or a significant contributor, so the submission needs to come from an account the check recognizes.

2. The brands check fails: there are no brand assets under `custom_components/newtron/brand/`, and there's no entry in home-assistant/brands. The repo has a `brands_submission/` folder and a root `logo.png`, but those aren't the locations HACS and Home Assistant look at. Add at least `icon.png` (and optionally `logo.png`) under `custom_components/newtron/brand/`.

Once the owner check passes and the brand assets are in place, please open a fresh PR via the publishing wizard.

