One thing worth a look for a future release: the debug-level logging in `api.py` dumps the full fetched billing page (which includes personal data like phone numbers and usage) and the CSRF cookie values into the Home Assistant log. Trimming those debug lines would keep account details out of a shared debug log.

Approving and merging now.

