Hi @igorek24, thanks for the submission! 👋

The diff on this PR rewrites the entire `integration` catalog file (nearly every line shows as changed, roughly +2860/-2860) rather than adding your single entry. That usually happens when an editor reformats the file or converts its line endings, and it means the change can't be merged as a clean one-line addition (it also conflicts with `master`).

Could you reset the `integration` file to match the current `hacs/default` master and then add only your one line, `igorek24/ted5000-home-assistant`, in the correct sorted position? Once the diff is just that single added line and CI is green, I'll take another look.

